{"id":"ab5fcf403a287209","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-top-lindelof-space.md","title":"ZFC Top Lindelof Space","display":"df-zfc-top-lindelof-space — ZFC Top Lindelof Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top-lindelof-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top-lindelof-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top-lindelof-space — ZFC Top Lindelof Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top-lindelof-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top-lindelof-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top-lindelof-space — ZFC Top Lindelof Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopLindelofSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopLindelofSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}lindelof\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopLindelofSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall C\\;(C\\subseteq\\tau\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup C\\to \\exists D\\;(D\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D)\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup D))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}lindelof\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopLindelofSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall C\\;(C\\subseteq\\tau\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup C\\to \\exists D\\;(D\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D)\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup D))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lindelöf 性要求每个开覆盖都有至多可数的子覆盖；空空间与有限子覆盖也由“至多可数”谓词统一涵盖。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anch